{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Implemented on worktree b5-aerial-flameproof-antbear, commit ca6d8e8018b (on origin/main 39d78c81fd5). Product: git_locking takes both advisory locks through lock_kernel (msvcrt leg on Windows; with no leg it returns before creating a lock file); _proc.reap_process_group off POSIX also terminates every descendant found by a Toolhelp parent-pid walk (best-effort). Implementation note beyond the plan text: test_acli_subprocess_timeout.py::test_non_posix_reaper_uses_kill_not_killpg forces os.name=nt with a fake pid 4321 and has no POSIX_ONLY marker, so on the Windows sweep the real walk would have terminated any runner process naming 4321 as parent; the test now stubs _windows_process_table to an empty table (file added to file_impact). Removed 9 lines from posix-api.args; 6 remain: test_opcert_own_pub_resolution_d26a::test_certifies_when_the_key_dir_is_read_only (now skipped on Windows: chmod cannot make a Windows directory unwritable - intentionally unsupported), 3 test_gate_peak_rss_9ea3 lines (decision b), test_snapshot_janitor::test_eviction_rename_to_trash_open_reader_survives (decision a), test_opcert_producer_seam_8d8e::test_key_genesis_permissions_and_gitignore (decision c). macOS: 220 targeted tests pass; ruff, complexity ratchet and mechanism ratchet (exit 0) clean. Windows validation dispatched 2026-11-22 13:26 PST: test.yml run 45072089680 on tmp/b5-aerial-flameproof-antbear. make verify running. Decision (c) note: cloistered-decomposed-nymph (closed) already records the operator decision (option 3, 2026-11-18) that Windows relies on the default ACL, with icacls evidence that ssh-keygen gives the minted key owner/SYSTEM/Administrators only."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1795382801411896001,"uuid":"c5db9372-195d-430a-93ff-79d0cfa03f3e"}